    description: "strace with HF_ENDPOINT and proxies at a closed local port: default sketch with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=0 or false made 1 connect (unset: 0); cached models loaded in every run. SECURITY.md disclosed it as 'your setting wins'."  # b82b
    fields:  # b82b
      statement: "Analysis makes no network request to Hugging Face whatever HF_HUB_OFFLINE the user has set."  # b82b
      root_cause: "_ensure_hf_offline_for_cached_models forced HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 only when unset or empty. huggingface_hub reads only 1/ON/YES/TRUE as offline, once at import, so HF_HUB_OFFLINE=0 kept the hub online; the loader's later set to 1 comes after the import."  # b82b
